# Raw downloads for the prepare_*.py scripts. Fetch them with the curl command
# in each script's docstring; they are reproducible, so they stay out of git.
credit/credit.csv
jannis2/jannis.csv
jannis4/jannis_41168.pq

# Generated jannis splits: ~27 MB (2-class) and ~39 MB (4-class) each, so five
# seeds of both would add ~350 MB to a 59 MB repository. They regenerate
# deterministically from the fixed seeds; rsync them to the clusters instead of
# committing them. The credit splits (~0.9 MB each) are small enough to track,
# like magic_*.csv.
jannis2/jannis2_*.csv
jannis4/jannis4_*.csv